{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dbusErrorNewForDbusError"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"dbusErrorName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafePointer","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"gchar","preciseIdentifier":"c:gtypes.h@T@gchar"},{"kind":"text","text":">!, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"dbusErrorMessage"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafePointer","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"gchar","preciseIdentifier":"c:gtypes.h@T@gchar"},{"kind":"text","text":">!) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ErrorRef","preciseIdentifier":"s:4GLib8ErrorRefV"},{"kind":"text","text":"!"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Errors registered with [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.register_error"},{"type":"text","text":"] will be looked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorName"},{"type":"text","text":" and if a match is found, the error domain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and code is used. Applications can use [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.get_remote_error"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to recover "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorName"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a match against a registered error is not found and the D-Bus"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"error name is in a form as returned by [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.encode_gerror"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the error domain and code encoded in the name is used to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create the [type[GLibError](\/\/documentation\/glib\/gliberror]. Also, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorName"},{"type":"text","text":" is added to the error"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message such that it can be recovered with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.get_remote_error"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Otherwise, a [type[GLibError](\/\/documentation\/glib\/gliberror] with the error code"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[error"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.IOErrorEnum.DBUS_ERROR"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the [error"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GIO\/documentation\/GIO\/IOErrorEnum"},{"type":"text","text":"] error domain is returned. Also, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorName"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"added to the error message such that it can be recovered with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.get_remote_error"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In all three cases, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorName"},{"type":"text","text":" can always be recovered from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returned [type[GLibError](\/\/documentation\/glib\/gliberror] using the [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.get_remote_error"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function (unless [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Gio.DBusError.strip_remote_error"},{"type":"text","text":"] hasn’t been used on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the returned error)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This function is typically only used in object mappings to prepare"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[type[GLibError](\/\/documentation\/glib\/gliberror] instances for applications. Regular applications should not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use it."}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gio\/dbuserrornewfordbuserror(dbuserrorname:dbuserrormessage:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GIO\/documentation\/GIO\/dbusErrorNewForDbusError(dbusErrorName:dbusErrorMessage:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a [type[GLibError](\/\/documentation\/glib\/gliberror] based on the contents of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorName"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dbusErrorMessage"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dbusErrorNewForDbusError"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"dbusErrorName"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafePointer","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"gchar","preciseIdentifier":"c:gtypes.h@T@gchar"},{"kind":"text","text":">!, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"dbusErrorMessage"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnsafePointer","preciseIdentifier":"s:SP"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"gchar","preciseIdentifier":"c:gtypes.h@T@gchar"},{"kind":"text","text":">!) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ErrorRef","preciseIdentifier":"s:4G